# Warm the platen and shroud to a temperature
# Sets both zones to the temperature, turns their thermal control on and waits for
# each to reach it, for at most the minutes given. A zone already at or above it
# ends its wait at once. Both zones stay on, holding the temperature, until a step
# turns them off. The shroud stops at 120 °C and the platen at 200 °C.
block warm to <temperature:number 0..100 C> within <minutes:number 1..600 min>
load rLACO

hvc platen {temperature}
hvc shroud {temperature}
hvc platen on
hvc shroud on
until platenT >= {temperature} C within {minutes} min
until shroudT >= {temperature} C within {minutes} min
